WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.639
The registry lets anyone inspect evidence records and recompute a commitment locally, without relying on our server.

2
00:00:07.589 --> 00:00:16.222
Each row shows the method version, evidence grade and status, including visible revocations and disclosed related-party cases.

3
00:00:16.222 --> 00:00:23.461
These are demonstration records, not real certifications, customer claims or proof of commercial adoption.

4
00:00:23.461 --> 00:00:30.935
Use the browser tool to calculate SHA-256 from a canonical payload; the input stays on your device.

5
00:00:30.935 --> 00:00:37.407
When citing a result, record the date, record count, method version and chain head.
